## Screeps

Screeps is an RTS MMO game for programmers that I've returned to a couple times
over the years. It has a remarkably low barrier to entry paired with the most
depth I've seen in coding games, and at the time of writing I've completely
remade my bot code at least 4 times as I improve both in the game and in coding
in general.

My bot is [public](https://github.com/Temoffy/screeps-typescript-starter) for
ease of access, which I'm not worried about because there are much better bots
to fork if someone's lazy and if someone finds an exploit in my code, that helps
me improve. I'm currently building a task system based roughly around the method
explained by

If you're considering getting into it, I recommend starting with
[The Farmer Was Replaced](https://store.steampowered.com/app/2060160/The_Farmer_Was_Replaced/)
as a shorter, more guided, and more beginner friendly game before going to
screeps.
